arious thermal pools are spread throughout the spacious outer terrace, each surrounded by a stone ledge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_12","text":"Inside, there are also spaces for relaxing, which is exactly what you'd expect to find in a traditional resort.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_13","text":"It truly is the perfect version of a hot spring, both inside and out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_14","text":"Did you build this all on your own?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_15","text":"Of course not, that'd be impossible!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_16","text":"Everyone in Unlimited pitched in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_neverland1_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_neverland1_03_s_17","text":"We also communicated with Mighty Tools, and they 